# Sessions Overview = only day look-here

Victor's day-to-day surface is **Sessions Overview** (admin Sessions hub → week/day board). Do **not** open LOCAL for day-of checks.

Standing term staff + booked kids repeat every week; **exceptions** come from `schedule_overrides` + `staff_unavailability` and must paint for **admin Overview**, **Staff Today**, and **parent term chips**.

## How to change the day

| Where | What it writes | Overview sees it via |
|-------|----------------|----------------------|
| **Schedule & Covers** | `schedule_overrides` (+ MADRE fold) | Hub expand + override paint |
| **Validate day** | `staff_unavailability` + COVER NEEDED overrides | Same (+ Day off / COVER chrome) |
| **HR Add day off** | `staff_unavailability` + COVER NEEDED when booked slots exist | Same (call `portalSyncOverviewDayTruth`) |
| **Finish booking / trial paid** | dated `portal_roster_rows` + trial override + MADRE fold | Same |
| **Edit term slot** | `portal_roster_rows` (rest of term) | Roster refresh |
| **Cursor / machine** | `portal_roster_canonical.js` (optional LOCAL port) | Deploy + refresh |

After portal day writes, call **`portalSyncOverviewDayTruth`** so MADRE / roster / override / **staff_unavailability** caches and the Overview board stay current.

## Parents (term chips)

- `slot_close` / club cancel → cancelled chip (no WhatsApp required)
- `instructor_reassign` → Team cover name (only when a real cover is assigned)
- Client absence / replace → absent chips
- **Do not** show instructor day offs / COVER NEEDED / Cover TBC on the parent hub — that is office/staff only

## LOCAL vs Overview

- **Overview** = **only** runtime look-here (canonical + MADRE + `portal_roster_rows` + `schedule_overrides` + `staff_unavailability`).
- **LOCAL** (`local_dc_staff_week.html`) = optional Autumn **authoring / machine port** only — not consulted day-to-day.
- Do **not** make Overview read LOCAL HTML in the browser.
- Prefer day exceptions via Schedule & Covers / Validate / HR day off (DB) instead of new one-off hardcodes in LOCAL/canonical.

## Agent habits

1. When Victor says something is wrong on the day board, check **Overview** first, then Schedule & Covers / overrides / unavailability / dated roster rows — never LOCAL as look-here.
2. After Schedule / Validate / HR day off / booking day writes, ensure Overview refresh is wired (do not leave caches stale).
3. Alerts / notifications (admin bell, staff/lead push, parent family alerts, outstanding-feedback nag) are **live** again after Autumn rota sign-off (reactivated 8 Sep 2026).
